    - {req: R-003, verdict: partially-covered, spec: "spec.md:12 requires tests that exercise both the ordinary greeting and empty-input rejection.", tasklist: "proposed.md:10 says 'Add ordinary and empty-name test cases'. It does not require asserting the exact string or the ValueError, so tests that run but assert nothing would satisfy it."}
